        "query": "WITH ins AS (\n    INSERT INTO findings (article_id, software_name, company_name, domain, evidence)\n    VALUES ($1, NULLIF($2, ''), NULLIF($3, ''), NULLIF($4, ''), $5)\n    ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING\n    RETURNING id\n)\nSELECT (SELECT id FROM ins) IS NOT NULL AS created,\n       (SELECT id FROM ins)             AS finding_id;",
        "toolDescription": "Create exactly one breach finding for the article currently being analysed. Call this only when the article describes a real, confirmed security incident. Do not provide article_id; it is supplied automatically. Returns created=true with a finding_id when the row was inserted, or created=false with finding_id=null when this finding already exists."
